{
  "name": "Cold outreach: research each lead and write Gmail drafts (never sends)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Cold outreach drafts (original)\nReads a `leads` sheet (email, first_name, company, website, notes, status, do_not_contact). For up to `max_per_run` rows with an empty status it reads the website, writes a short personalised email and saves it as a **Gmail draft**. Then marks the row `drafted` or `needs_research`.\nThere is no send node. You review and send from Gmail.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "ec10fbb4-3adb-5169-b78d-21e3c6535e58",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        -400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "8692cbc6-832a-51ce-83bd-e8f2fecaeee9",
      "name": "Run now",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "weeksInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtDay": [
                1,
                2,
                3,
                4,
                5
              ],
              "triggerAtHour": 8,
              "triggerAtMinute": 30
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "561b3d42-65f9-5bc4-bb09-b35561935074",
      "name": "Weekdays 08:30",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "4cbeadf0-673d-56fd-955e-4e07eeacdedc",
              "name": "sheet_url",
              "value": "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/REPLACE_WITH_SHEET_ID/edit",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "bc188c0c-a7c3-5e81-8f79-2e2184070efe",
              "name": "sender_name",
              "value": "Your Name",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "bff8144f-01e6-5d32-983f-e0ccb5300376",
              "name": "offer",
              "value": "A 2-week fixed-price sprint that ships one AI automation into production",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "1a177c5b-463b-5947-b8cc-bb2942ed42e1",
              "name": "proof",
              "value": "Link to one case study or repo that shows the result",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "6dd7f729-7ca6-54c6-a395-89f9f7582d08",
              "name": "max_per_run",
              "value": 10,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "9a5ed994-66dd-598b-bcb3-196405f9727c",
              "name": "min_confidence",
              "value": 0.6,
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "20eece79-93a2-56b1-b9ce-ea7c62c2eb53",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": "={{ $json.sheet_url }}"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "leads"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "ec8dbfa4-842b-563d-9470-089e26200a32",
      "name": "Read leads",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const cfg = $('Config').first().json;\nconst rows = $input.all().map(i => i.json)\n  .filter(r => r.email && !String(r.status || '').trim() && String(r.do_not_contact || '').toLowerCase() !== 'yes')\n  .slice(0, Number(cfg.max_per_run || 10));\nreturn rows.map(r => ({ json: { ...r, website: r.website ? (/^https?:\\/\\//.test(r.website) ? r.website : 'https://' + r.website) : '' } }));"
      },
      "id": "5a2f8148-6bea-5b5c-856e-8a6adf6fd8c1",
      "name": "Pick leads to draft",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $json.website || 'https://no-website.invalid' }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "text"
            }
          },
          "timeout": 10000
        }
      },
      "id": "1159e121-b1f4-55d2-9c33-c8166be45dca",
      "name": "Fetch website",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        960,
        0
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "const lead = $('Pick leads to draft').item.json;\nconst html = String($json.data || '');\nconst text = html.replace(/<script[\\s\\S]*?<\\/script>/gi, ' ').replace(/<style[\\s\\S]*?<\\/style>/gi, ' ')\n  .replace(/<[^>]+>/g, ' ').replace(/\\s+/g, ' ').trim().slice(0, 5000);\nreturn { json: { ...lead, site_text: text } };"
      },
      "id": "d5ca394e-77c4-5736-9e2f-3e8cba4b7f44",
      "name": "Website to text",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1200,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=First name: {{ $json.first_name || 'there' }}\nCompany: {{ $json.company }}\nNotes: {{ $json.notes || 'none' }}\nWebsite text:\n{{ $json.site_text || 'not available' }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "=You write one cold email from {{ $('Config').first().json.sender_name }}. Offer: {{ $('Config').first().json.offer }}. Proof: {{ $('Config').first().json.proof }}.\nRules: under 110 words, plain text, one specific observation about their company taken from the website text or notes (quote the fact in personalization_fact), one clear ask (a 15-minute call), no flattery, no fake familiarity, no links except the proof.\nconfidence (0-1) = how sure you are the personal observation is accurate. If the website text is empty or generic, confidence must be below 0.5."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "be0e6e55-2025-58da-9aee-57761ef4f36a",
      "name": "Draft email",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        1440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini",
          "cachedResultName": "gpt-4o-mini"
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.2
        }
      },
      "id": "4d5fdebf-3093-5b0e-bc3f-2187517d907a",
      "name": "Draft email - model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1368,
        200
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "OpenAI (or OpenAI-compatible) account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "schemaType": "manual",
        "inputSchema": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"subject\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"body\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"personalization_fact\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"confidence\": {\n      \"type\": \"number\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"subject\",\n    \"body\",\n    \"personalization_fact\",\n    \"confidence\"\n  ],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}"
      },
      "id": "5400dd02-0aaf-567a-a724-595f7cadb155",
      "name": "Draft email - JSON schema",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
